WEBVTT

00:36:58.954 --> 00:37:02.163
the steps that were supposed to work
based on all the existing science,

00:37:02.163 --> 00:37:06.871
didn't you know one of those was was
just creating a common identity

00:37:06.871 --> 00:37:10.329
as baseball fans? And, you know,
people would say, yeah, you know,

00:37:10.329 --> 00:37:13.288
I would help a Yankees fan if
they were in an emergency.

00:37:13.288 --> 00:37:17.121
But otherwise, you know, they're rooting
for an evil team. So no, thank you.

00:37:18.121 --> 00:37:22.038
And then the other one was to to try
to humanize the individual fan,

00:37:22.496 --> 00:37:26.371
where basically what happened was people
said, all right, you know what?

00:37:26.579 --> 00:37:30.704
There's this one Yankees fan who's OK,
but he's not like the other ones.